{"base_rate":0.4951321279554937,"brier":0.18038595271210012,"bss":0.27838779134552905,"bss_hi":0.358532936929963,"bss_lo":0.19544113045538067,"chart":{"base":[490.0,169.4],"fp":[366.4,255.6],"lead":"62,278.5 272,276.2 482,270.9 692,258.2","note":{"base":"skill 0.28 — higher than 47% of cities","fp":"low end +10pp, high end +11pp","lead":"day-1 error 0.8 °C — better than 89% of cities","rel":"promised 3% → rained 9%; promised 99% → rained 87%"},"rel":"80.5,427 191.4,338.9 384,234.3 580.2,178 686.9,89.8"},"country":"TO","deep":false,"depth":["Rain-probability calibration","Calibration curve","Seasonal split"],"ece":0.08961057023643954,"ess":393.63305275039306,"html":{"answer":"\n<h2 id=\"answer\">The short answer for Nuku&#x27;alofa</h2>\n<div class=\"verdict\">\n<p class=\"lead\"><b>The Nuku&#x27;alofa rain forecast is moderately skilful, though 6 points on its probability scale are off by more than chance explains.</b></p>\n<p>When it says rain is <i>near certain</i> (99%), believe about\n<b>87%</b>. When it says rain is <i>very unlikely</i>\n(0%), there is still roughly a <b>6%</b> chance.</p>\n<p class=\"muted\">Based on 719 days, 2024-04-26 to\n2026-05-31. \"Rain\" means at least 0.2 mm measured at\nthe station, 12.8 km from the forecast grid point.\nSkill score 0.28, ranked 114 of\n216 &mdash; but see the rank <i>range</i>\n(75&ndash;152) before reading anything into\nthat position.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3>What the percentages actually mean here</h3>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th class=\"num\">It said</th><th class=\"num\">It rained</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Days</th><th>Verdict</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='num'>0%</td><td class='num'><b>6%</b></td><td class='num'>52</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">underpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>4%</td><td class='num'><b>11%</b></td><td class='num'>92</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">underpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>14%</td><td class='num'><b>30%</b></td><td class='num'>66</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">underpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>27%</td><td class='num'><b>29%</b></td><td class='num'>70</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>43%</td><td class='num'><b>46%</b></td><td class='num'>78</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>60%</td><td class='num'><b>62%</b></td><td class='num'>73</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>75%</td><td class='num'><b>58%</b></td><td class='num'>67</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>89%</td><td class='num'><b>74%</b></td><td class='num'>74</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>99%</td><td class='num'><b>87%</b></td><td class='num'>147</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">6 of 9 groups are further from honest than chance\nalone can explain. The rest are indistinguishable from a perfect forecast.</p>\n","card":"\n<div class=\"gcard\">\n  <p class=\"gcard-head\"><b>Nuku&#x27;alofa</b> <span class=\"muted\">Tonga</span></p>\n  <div class=\"gcard-tier\"><span class=\"tag ok\">Moderately skilful</span><details class=\"ginfo\"><summary aria-label=\"What does this label mean?\" title=\"What does this label mean?\">?</summary><div class=\"ginfo-pop\" role=\"note\"><p>Compared with a simple guess: saying &ldquo;50% chance of rain&rdquo; every day, because it rains here on 50% of days.</p><p>The forecast did better.</p><p><a href=\"#bss\">How the skill score works</a></p></div></details>\n    <span class=\"muted\">6 points off by more than chance</span></div>\n  <dl class=\"gcard-stats\">\n    <div><dt>Skill score<details class=\"ginfo\"><summary aria-label=\"What is the skill score?\" title=\"What is the skill score?\">?</summary><div class=\"ginfo-pop\" role=\"note\"><p>How much better the forecast is than that simple guess. 0 mea